      "text": "The repo ships eleven agent definition files (orchestrator, plan-runner, code-executor, test-verifier, code-reviewer, docs-reviewer, security-reviewer, spec-critic, api-docs-researcher, host-security-investigator, code-explorer), a plugin source file, model profiles, and skills directories."
